ora</text><text x="612.5" y="903" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="700" fill="#222" text-anchor="middle">aprova?</text><text x="367.5" y="805" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="800" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="middle">NÃO</text><text x="857.5" y="805" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="800" fill="#079447" text-anchor="middle">SIM</text><line x1="432.5" y1="875" x2="262.5" y2="875" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="262.5" y1="875" x2="262.5" y2="955" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><line x1="792.5" y1="875" x2="962.5" y2="875" stroke="#079447" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="962.5" y1="875" x2="962.5" y2="955" stroke="#079447" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="75" y="955" width="430" height="90" rx="14" fill="#fff1f3" stroke="#ff6b7c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="110" y="993" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Devolvido: Devolvido (com justificativa)</text><text x="155" y="1025" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="600" fill="#e11d48" text-anchor="start">corrige e reenvia</text><rect x="75" y="1060" width="430" height="90" rx="14" fill="#fff1f3" stroke="#ff6b7c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="110" y="1098" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Rejeitado (com justificativa)</text><text x="155" y="1130" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="600" fill="#e11d48" text-anchor="start">fim do fluxo — sem reenvio</text><rect x="720" y="955" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#effcf4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2"/><text x="755" y="1003" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="22" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Aprovado</text><rect x="720" y="1047" width="430" height="86" rx="14" fill="#f1fbf5" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2"/><text x="755" y="1085" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">$  Tesouraria marca como Pago</text><text x="755" y="1113" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="500" fill="#345" text-anchor="start">(informa a data)</text><rect x="720" y="1147" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#4b7bec" stroke-width="2"/><text x="755" y="1195" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Tesouraria arquiva</text><polygon points="1787.5,905.0 1967.5,970 1787.5,1035.0 1607.5,970" fill="#fff4c7" stroke="#e59b00" stroke-width="4"/><text x="1787.5" y="978" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="700" fill="#222" text-anchor="middle">Tesouraria confirma?</text><text x="1542.5" y="900" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="800" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="middle">NÃO</text><text x="2032.5" y="900" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="23" font-weight="800" fill="#079447" text-anchor="middle">SIM</text><line x1="1607.5" y1="970" x2="1437.5" y2="970" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="1437.5" y1="970" x2="1437.5" y2="1050" stroke="#d90429" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><line x1="1967.5" y1="970" x2="2137.5" y2="970" stroke="#079447" stroke-width="4"/><line x1="2137.5" y1="970" x2="2137.5" y2="1050" stroke="#079447" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="1250" y="1050" width="430" height="90" rx="14" fill="#fff1f3" stroke="#ff6b7c" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1285" y="1088" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Devolvido: Devolvido à origem</text><text x="1330" y="1120" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="19" font-weight="600" fill="#e11d48" text-anchor="start">corrige e reenvia</text><rect x="1895" y="1050" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#effcf4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1930" y="1098" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Recebido pela Tesouraria</text><rect x="1895" y="1142" width="430" height="95" rx="14" fill="#f4f1ff" stroke="#7b61ff" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1930" y="1178" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">R  Se Honorários &gt; 0, o sistema gera</text><text x="1930" y="1208" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">automaticamente o Repasse Societário</text><rect x="1895" y="1252" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#4b7bec" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1930" y="1300" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Encerrar operação</text><rect x="70" y="1360" width="1085" height="55" rx="12" fill="#fff0f2" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="100" y="1396" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="start">▥  Reflexos no sistema: Auditoria, Relatórios e DRE Gerencial</text><rect x="1245" y="1360" width="1085" height="55" rx="12" fill="#eef8ff" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1275" y="1396" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#075f9c" text-anchor="start">▥  Reflexos no sistema: Auditoria, Relatórios, Classificação e DRE Gerencial</text><rect x="40" y="1470" width="2320" height="430" rx="22" fill="#fff" stroke="#cfc6ff" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="40" y="1470" width="2320" height="95" rx="22" fill="#5b45d6" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="80" y="1518" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="42" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="start">R</text><text x="145" y="1512" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="32" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="start">Sub-fluxo automático: Repasse Societário</text><text x="145" y="1546" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="500" fill="#fff" text-anchor="start">Disparado pela Receita — não é uma decisão manual da Tesouraria</text><rect x="1970" y="1487" width="350" height="62" rx="14" fill="#6c55e8" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="2145" y="1515" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Beneficiário padrão:</text><text x="2145" y="1539" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">Ana Müller — 40%</text><rect x="75" y="1605" width="390" height="95" rx="14" fill="#f4f1ff" stroke="#8c7ae6" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="110" cy="1653" r="22" fill="#5b45d6" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="110" y="1661" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">1</text><text x="150" y="1643" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="800" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Apurado</text><text x="150" y="1672" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="17" font-weight="500" fill="#345" text-anchor="start">(40% dos Honorários, calculado automaticamente)</text><line x1="465" y1="1653" x2="540" y2="1653" stroke="#5b45d6" stroke-width="4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="540" y="1605" width="360" height="95" rx="14" fill="#f4f1ff" stroke="#8c7ae6" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="575" cy="1653" r="22" fill="#5b45d6" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="575" y="1661" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#fff" text-anchor="middle">2</text><text x="615" y="1661" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="800" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Enviar para aprovação</text><l